| `input_adb_lookup(a.csv)`
```### Split multivalue fields ###```
| foreach sensitive, insensitive, insensitive2 [eval <<FIELD>>=split(<<FIELD>>, "|")]
```### Convert case insensitive fields to lowercase ###```
| foreach insensitive, insensitive2 [eval <<FIELD>>=lower(<<FIELD>>)]
```### Ignore values ###```
| eval sensitive = if(in(sensitive, ""), null(), sensitive) insensitive = if(in(insensitive, ""), null(), insensitive) insensitive2 = if(in(insensitive2, ""), null(), insensitive2)
```### Map source lookup to source name ###```
| eval source=case(source_lookup="a.csv", "a")
| search _key=*
| stats values(source) as source, values(source_lookup) as source_lookup, values(sensitive) as sensitive, values(insensitive) as insensitive, values(insensitive2) as insensitive2 by _key
| adbmerge max_keys=25
| eval _key = md5(mvjoin(mvsort(asset), "::"))
| stats values(asset) as asset, values(source) as source, values(source_lookup) as source_lookup, values(sensitive) as sensitive, values(insensitive) as insensitive, values(insensitive2) as insensitive2 by _key
```### Trim multivalue fields ###```
| eval sensitive = mvindex(sensitive,0,4), insensitive = mvindex(insensitive,0,4), insensitive2 = mvindex(insensitive2,0,4)
```### Output to KV store ###```
| table _key, asset, source, source_lookup, sensitive, insensitive, insensitive2
| outputlookup assetdb
